{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國總統特朗普談會晤中國國家主席習近平與俄羅斯總統普京時稱，朝鮮領導人金正恩可能會來。</p><figure><img alt=\"2026年11月16日，美國總統特朗普在華盛頓白宮啟程前往菲律賓和中國時，向傳媒發表演說。（Reuters）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199131693139628032918032.jpeg/wEMIa1zA0F0QfYFPZXASHb6o9p6hbiNHLf1g4S39YOE\"/><figcaption>2026年11月16日，美國總統特朗普在華盛頓白宮啟程前往菲律賓和中國時，向傳媒發表演說。（Reuters）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:59:28.953150+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:41:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:53:01.539478+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:53:01.539478+00:00","content_hash":"4fccadda919591e2a9c1849741135c0c9a88db46aac144f1b3c1239655acf8fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}